{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「隼太……」", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 304, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ht0647", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這次，隼太只是沉默地拍拍我的肩。", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天是期末考試最後一天。", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "連日來與美羽學姊的「讀書會」也結束了。", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是，我不能就此停滯不前。", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不要怨嘆過去，要注視前方。", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "跟至今為止不像話的自己說再見。", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "沉浸在考試結束後的輕鬆感中，我走向社團教室。", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然後在外面的飲水處看見美羽學姊的身影。", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕嚕。」", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 308, "voice": "pn0380", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔呼呼，好冷好冷喔～♪」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "mu1638", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊帶著和平常一樣的笑容正在幫熊喵洗腳。", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯咻。好了，用毛巾把腳腳擦乾喔～」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "mu1639", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕～♪」", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 308, "voice": "pn0381", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "熊喵只要腳弄髒了，就一定會去找人來幫牠洗。", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為不洗乾淨的話牠就不能趴在學姊的頭上。所以至今為止牠從來沒有弄髒過我們的衣服。", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「熊喵，洗乾淨太好了呢～」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 304, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗚嚕～」", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 308, "voice": "pn0382", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，新吾君辛苦了。考試順利結束了？」", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "mu1640", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「請不要問我結果。」", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 304, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔～是我害的吧。」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "mu1641", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不，只是我的意志太薄弱而已。」", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 304, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "結果，考試期間我去學姊房間都不是在念書。", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天開始必須稍微自重點才行。", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……新吾君，今天也要來我家嗎？」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "mu1642", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "嗯，自重是不可能的了。", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果不會給妳添麻煩的話。」", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 304, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，那放學就一起回去吧♪」", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "mu1643", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "明明這些天來都讓學姊看到我丟臉的樣子，但她的態度一點也沒有變。", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我必須盡快回應她的這份溫柔才行啊，身為一個男人……", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕……」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 308, "voice": "pn0383", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……也差不多該幫小熊喵洗澡了呢～」", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "mu1644", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕嚕！」", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 308, "voice": "pn0384", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「學姊都在家幫牠洗澡嗎？」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 304, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，沒錯喔～因為小熊喵很愛乾淨，所以最喜歡洗澡了，對吧？」", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "mu1645", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕～♪」", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 308, "voice": "pn0385", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過即使如此，美羽學姊還是沒有把熊喵養在家裡。", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊還是忘不了小時候養的那隻因病死掉的貓吧。", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "熊喵應該也是想和美羽學姊一起生活的……", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……新吾君也要跟小熊喵一起洗澡嗎？」", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "mu1646", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不，那有點……」", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 304, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我知道自己一定會對學姊出手。", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔呼呼，我好像也想跟新吾君兩個人一起洗呢♪」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "mu1647", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在進浴室前，我想先進入學姊的體內！", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "認真這樣想的我，已經再也離不開學姊了吧……", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎麼了，紗凪？好不容易考試結束了，妳待在這種地方……」", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 301, "voice": "ar4416", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……沒怎樣啊。」", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 312, "voice": "sn1408", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「該不會還放不下那個人？」", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 301, "voice": "ar4417", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「妳很煩欸，愛理。」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 312, "voice": "sn1409", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我是擔心紗凪……」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 301, "voice": "ar4418", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我知道。我很感謝愛理。」", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 312, "voice": "sn1410", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 301, "voice": "ar4419", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊～啊，去把手機號碼解約好了。」", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 312, "voice": "sn1411", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「為什麼？手機辦了就辦了，很方便不是嗎？」", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 301, "voice": "ar4420", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是沒錯啦。」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 312, "voice": "sn1412", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「妳也常常跟天羽學姊通郵件不是嗎？」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 301, "voice": "ar4421", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 312, "voice": "sn1413", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有煩惱的話就說出來，我陪妳聊聊。」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 301, "voice": "ar4422", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「與其說煩惱，應該是自我厭惡……」", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 312, "voice": "sn1414", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「自我厭惡？」", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 301, "voice": "ar4423", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「自從告訴新吾手機號碼後……我就一直在期待手機響起。」", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 312, "voice": "sn1415", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「期待會不會是那傢伙打來或發來的郵件。」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 312, "voice": "sn1416", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 301, "voice": "ar4424", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「到了半夜，偶爾還會想聽聽那傢伙的聲音。到底為什麼呢……」", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 312, "voice": "sn1417", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唉……妳什麼時候變成那種女孩子了啊？」", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 301, "voice": "ar4425", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我自己也不知道。但是，改變了我的是那傢伙。雖然不想承認。」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 312, "voice": "sn1418", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「女人真不應該談戀愛呢。」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 301, "voice": "ar4426", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……雖然會是很好的經驗。」", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 312, "voice": "sn1419", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哼嗯～那就趁這機會成為戀愛達人試試看吧？」", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 301, "voice": "ar4427", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那不可能。」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 312, "voice": "sn1420", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為，已經結束了啊。我最初也是最後的戀愛──」", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 312, "voice": "sn1421", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、啊、學姊、等……」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 304, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊啊──！？」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 304, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "mu1648", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……啊……美羽……學姊……」", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 304, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「射了好多出來……好厲害呢……」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "mu1649", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈啊、哈啊……哈啊……哈啊……」", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 304, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天的挑戰結束了。", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天又被學姊榨得一乾二淨。", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "身體好沉重。", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只要閉上眼，好像就會直接睡得像一攤泥。", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾君，你的眼神好迷濛……很舒服嗎？」", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "mu1650", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 304, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "當我還在放空的時候，學姊吻了我。", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯、啾、啊姆、啾、咧溜、咧嚕、嗯嗯、啾、啾、嗯嗯……」", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "mu1651", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她一邊糾纏我的舌頭，一邊套弄我的傢伙，整根都被精液抹得濕黏。", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……再多努力一下吧？」", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "mu1652", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、啊、啊……」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 304, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊加快節奏套弄，我忍耐不住地發出呻吟。", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊沾滿精液的手挑逗著我，幾乎要把我玩壞。", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾君可愛的表情，還想再看更多……」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "mu1653", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊、啊啊啊啊！？」", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 304, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……解脫的方法，我還毫無所知。", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
